---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: investor claims tokens
    q_check_paused --> q_check_supplied: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_not_claimed: tokens have been supplied
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_not_supplied: tokens not supplied
    q_check_not_claimed --> q_verify_merkle: position not already settled
    q_check_not_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed
    q_verify_merkle --> q_check_vesting: verifyProof(claimMerkleRoot, leaf(investor, tokenAmount, vestingTerms))
    q_verify_merkle --> q_revert_proof: invalid Merkle proof
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: vestingTerms.duration > 0 (time-locked allocation)
    q_check_vesting --> q_direct_transfer: vestingTerms.duration == 0 (immediate allocation)
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer_to_vesting: deploy vesting contract, position.vestingAddress = vestingContract
    q_transfer_to_vesting --> q_mark_settled: transfer(vestingContract, tokenAmount)
    q_direct_transfer --> q_mark_settled: transfer(investor, tokenAmount)
    q_mark_settled --> [*]: position.hasSettled = true, emit TokensClaimed(investor, tokenAmount, vestingAddress)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_revert_not_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof

    note right of q_verify_merkle
        INV-001: Merkle proof must verify against published claimMerkleRoot
        INV-002: Each investor can claim exactly once (hasSettled flag)
    end note

    note right of q_deploy_vesting
        INV-003: Vesting contract deployed via EIP-1167 clone pattern
        INV-004: Vesting schedule immutable once deployed
    end note
